# 📊 Cost Optimization & Risk Detection Dashboard (2016–2024)

## 📌 Project Overview
This project analyzes 8 years of financial transaction data (2016–2024) using Power BI to identify:

- Cost concentration
- Profitability decline
- Liquidity risks
- Revenue instability
- Operational inefficiencies

The objective was to transform raw accounting data into actionable business insights that support financial decision-making and risk monitoring.

---

# 🎯 Business Problem

The business lacked visibility into:

- Which accounts were driving the majority of expenses
- Why profitability was declining
- Where cash flow risks existed
- Which financial areas management should prioritize first

Without centralized KPI monitoring, financial decisions remained reactive instead of data-driven.

