# 🧹 Data Cleaning & Preparation

## Cleaning Steps
- Removed duplicate records
- Standardized inconsistent account/category names
- Corrected invalid and missing values
- Validated transaction consistency
- Identified uncategorized expenses

## Key Data Quality Finding
- Identified approximately **$1.3M uncategorized transactions**, limiting financial transparency and reporting accuracy

