# 📊 KPI Selection & Business Reasoning

| KPI | Why It Matters |
|---|---|
| Net Profit | Measures overall business sustainability |
| Revenue vs Expense | Identifies profitability imbalance |
| Cash Flow Gap | Detects liquidity risk |
| Pareto Cost Analysis | Identifies high-impact cost drivers |
| Avg Transaction Value | Evaluates transaction efficiency |

